  "text": "QA-Restaurant-A-1791252294734\nADMIN\nQA-Restaurant-A-1791252294734\nCtrl+K\nNo open shift\nEOD Report\nReconciliation\nAssistant\nLogout\nOPERATIONS\nDashboard\nBilling / Invoices\nOrders\nLive Orders / KDS\nFloor / Tables\nReservations\nKitchen / KOT\nDIGITAL ORDERING\nQR Table Ordering\nON\nMENU & INVENTORY\nMenu & Categories\nCustomisations & Tax\nInventory & Recipes\nPurchasing & Stock Control\nPEOPLE & CASH\nCustomers CRM\nStaff & Roles (RBAC)\nPayments & Split\nOffers & Coupons\nShift & Cash Drawer\nKIOSK\nKiosk Terminals\nANALYTICS & SYSTEM\nReports & Analytics\nPrinters & Devices\nReceipt & E-Bill\nSync & Devices\nRestaurant Settings\nSubscription Plans\nAudit Trail Logs\nBackup & Restore\nHelp & Support\nSync & Devices\n\nWhether every terminal is in step with the cloud, and what needs your review.\n\nThis device: connection & diagnostics\nONLINE ● Connected\nConnected to the cloud. Everything is up to date.\nSync now\nBranch Core (restaurant server)\n\nThe always-on machine that lets every device work together without internet. Enter its address, e.g. 192.168.1.10. Leave empty to use the cloud only.\n\nConnect\nConnection\nCloud\nInternet verified\nYes\nWaiting to send\n0\nCould not send\n0\nOrders on this device\n0\nLocal storage\nHealthy\nApp version\n1.0.0\nStart this device fresh\n\nRemoves the staff list, orders and other data stored on this device and downloads this restaurant's own data again. Use it if you see staff, orders or items that are not yours. Orders not yet sent are set aside, not deleted.\n\nClear and re-download\nMenu publishing\n\nCurrent version: none yet\n\nPublish menu\nDevices\nDevice\tStatus\tPending\tMenu\tVersion\tProblem\nQA A POSPOS\tonline\t0\t—\t1.0.0\t\nQA A CAPTAINCAPTAIN\tonline\t0\t—\t1.0.0\t\nQA A KDSKDS\tonline\t0\t—\t1.0.0\t\nQA A KIOSKKIOSK\tonline\t0\t—\t1.0.0\t\nQA A POS_ADMINPOS_ADMIN\tonline\t0\t—\t1.0.0\t\nNeeds review (0)\nRefresh\n\nNothing to review. All synced data is consistent.\n\nThese are reported, never repaired automatically: payments and stock are reviewed by a person.\n\nJAMAN AI\nACTIVE",
